From 62856dd40c742314744a37bc2f05a02cb1e91351 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:41:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] media: histb-venc: add the V500 encoder backend

The v5 V500 of hi3798mv200h is not driven by register writes. It takes a
command image through DMA memory, owns a memory-management unit, and
codes P pictures with driver-written parameter sets. Add the v5 backend
behind the shared core: hardware programming, bitstream assembly and the
V4L2 session.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
