-	  programmed with register writes and a 64-byte packet ring, and codes
-	  IDR pictures only.
+	  The v2 VEDU of hi3716cv200 and hi3798mv100 -- the part the vendor
+	  calls V2R8, built through its venc_v1.0 layer -- is programmed by
+	  register writes and a 64-byte packet ring, and codes IDR pictures. The
+	  v5 V500 of hi3798mv200h (HiVEDUV500R001, the venc_v2.0 layer) takes a
